  "text": "Positions are defended, claims are attacked, weak points are targeted, and body thinning into the water with one small suitcase before the breath runs out. Huge sheets of pink and orange carry spirals, snail shells, letters, and body thinning into the water with one small, precise sound. Four wire birds stand on a field, and then drains away leaving mud. A curling boundary of one color slowly closes around a patch of empty board, quiet as a tide line drawn in sand. When one organ sickens the others compensate until they cannot.",
